#{[17592186441506 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186441452 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186441506 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186441468 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186441506 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186441470 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186441506 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186441476 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186441506 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186441484 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186441506 #edb/ref 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186441506 #edb/ref 1077 "selection" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186441506 #edb/ref 1078 #edb/ref 17592186441468 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186441506 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "b51e9cee-8316-54d2-839d-e8e2a267b6ba" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186441507 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186441498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186441507 #edb/ref 1069 "q-136497" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186441507 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186441507 #edb/ref 1071 "![](images/fd/fd1fdfcbf207a4bf4b4fa37126bf57f6b28d01cb64bc7f960a3f13c4795eef2e.png)\n\nThe point shown above represents a number on a number line. The absolute value of this number is $2.7.$ What is the number?" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186441507 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "0c9c7663-aff3-5fde-bcfd-2f3d35466cd0" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186441507 #edb/ref 1074 "The number is *positive* because it is to the *right* of zero.\n\nThe absolute value of the number is $2.7,$ so the distance between that number and zero on a number line is $2.7.$ \n\nThe positive number at a distance of $2.7$ from zero is $2.7.$\n\n![](images/ab/abb34ec8ead4b1b0f2b676e6ad385d94d63b609cea76f601a0d4f1331deaa1aa.png)" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186441508 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186441504 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186441508 #edb/ref 1069 "q-185415" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186441508 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186441508 #edb/ref 1071 "$|\\frac{11}{5}|\\,=\\,${{field-1}}" #e